  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>18</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>15</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5005",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>Binomial expression&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>15</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now general term is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>15</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>15</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p>For coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;equate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>15</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>5005</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
